0445+  4034             ;	Subroutine	check if keyboardinput available
0446+  4034             ;	Inputs		-
0447+  4034             ;	Outputs		Zx set if no input, Zx reset if input, A = input
0448+  4034             
0449+  4034 DD E5       A4034:	push	ix
0450+  4036 DD 21 B7 00 	ld	ix,BREAKX
