0092+  4026             CH_CMD_BYTE_RD_GO: equ 3Bh
0093+  4026             CH_CMD_BYTE_WRITE: equ 3Ch
0094+  4026             CH_CMD_BYTE_WRITE_GO: equ 3Dh
