1405+  443D             ; HW_GET_DEV_DESCR and HW_GET_CONFIG_DESCR
1406+  443D             ;
1407+  443D             ; Exectute the standard GET_DESCRIPTOR USB request
1408+  443D             ; to obtain the device descriptor or the configuration descriptor.
1409+  443D             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1410+  443D             ; Input:  DE = Address where the descriptor is to be read
1411+  443D             ;         A  = Device address
