1529+  4446                 ;  0x: Don't retry NAKs
1530+  4446                 ;  10: Retry NAKs indefinitely (default)
1531+  4446                 ;  11: Retry NAKs for 3s
1532+  4446                 ;Bits 5-0: Number of retries after device timeout
