0431+  4FAE             
0432+  4FAE             
0433+  4FAE             ;Disk parameters that are different for each disk format:
0434+  4FAE             ;+0: Sectors per cluster
0435+  4FAE             ;+4: Root directory entries
0436+  4FAE             ;+6,7: Sector count
0437+  4FAE             ;+8: Media ID
