0457+  5160 C9              ret
0458+  5161             
0459+  5161             
0460+  5161             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0461+  5161             ; Get the base address of work area for our slot
0462+  5161             ;
0463+  5161             ; This is the GETWRK routine copied from the kernel code with a small change:
0464+  5161             ; the address of the SLTWRK entry is returned directly, the original code
0465+  5161             ; assumes that at offset +2 there's a pointer for allocated space in page 3
0466+  5161             ; and returns this pointer.
0467+  5161             ;
