1334+  573F             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1335+  573F             ; USB_EXECUTE_CBI: Execute a command using CBI transport
1336+  573F             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1337+  573F             ; Input:  HL = Address of the 12 byte command to execute
1338+  573F             ;         DE = Address of the input or output data buffer
1339+  573F             ;         BC = Length of data to send or receive
1340+  573F             ;         Cy = 0 to receive data, 1 to send data
1341+  573F             ; Output: A  = USB error code
1342+  573F             ;         BC = Amount of data actually transferred (if IN transfer)
1343+  573F             ;         D  = ASC (if no error)
1344+  573F             ;         E  = ASCQ (if no error)
