0119+  5A47             ; CHECK_SAME_DRIVE
0120+  5A47             ;
0121+  5A47             ; If the drive passed in A is not the same that was passed last time,
0122+  5A47             ; display the "Insert disk for drive X:" message.
0123+  5A47             ; This is needed for phantom drive emulation.
0124+  5A47             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0125+  5A47             ; Input: 	A	Drive number
0126+  5A47             ; Preserves AF, BC, DE, HL
0127+  5A47             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0128+  5A47             
0129+  5A47             CHECK_SAME_DRIVE:
