0001+  5C58             ; MSXUSB USB FDD BIOS
0002+  5C58             ; Based on the Rookie Drive USB FDD BIOS created by Konamiman in 2018
0003+  5C58             ; This version is adapted to work with the latest version of the MSXUSB project
0004+  5C58             ;
0005+  5C58             ; This file contains the code for the boot menu that displays
0006+  5C58             ; a navigable list of disk image files (available only when a
0007+  5C58             ; standard USB mass storage device is plugged in).
0008+  5C58             
0009+  5C58             BM_MAX_DIR_NAME_LENGTH: equ 64
0010+  5C58             
0011+  5C58             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0012+  5C58             ; Boot menu entry point
0013+  5C58             ; 
0014+  5C58             ; The starting point is CURDIR, or if it isn't set, the main directory.
0015+  5C58             ;
0016+  5C58             ; Input:  A  = Where is this called from:
0017+  5C58             ;              0: Computer boot
0018+  5C58             ;              1: CALL USBMENU/SUBRESET
0019+  5C58             ; Output: A = 0 if a file was actually mounted
0020+  5C58             ;             1 if ESC or CTRL+STOP was pressed
0021+  5C58             ;             2 if not enough memory to start the menu
0022+  5C58             ;             3 if no storage device is present
0023+  5C58             ;             4 if error setting initial directory (not when F5-ing)
0024+  5C58             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0025+  5C58             
0026+  5C58             DO_BOOT_MENU:
0027+  5C58             
0028+  5C58                 ;Return with error if no storage device was found
