0533+  6E7D             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0534+  6E7D             ; DSK_MOUNT: Mount a file in the current directory
0535+  6E7D             ;            and update config file and work area;
0536+  6E7D             ;            in case of failure it restores the previously mounted file.
0537+  6E7D             ;
0538+  6E7D             ; This one is tricky as DSK_CHANGE_DIR_U, but even more because every time we
0539+  6E7D             ; want to mount a file (the requested one or the previous one) we need to ensure
0540+  6E7D             ; that the value of CURDIR is set as the current directory.
0541+  6E7D             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
