0543+  6E7D             ;         A  = 0: Mount as read-only if read-only flag is set
0544+  6E7D             ;              1: Force mount as read and write
0545+  6E7D             ;              2: Force mount as read-only
0546+  6E7D             ; Output: A  = 0: Ok
0547+  6E7D             ;              1: Other error
0548+  6E7D             ;              2: File not found
0549+  6E7D             ;              3: It's a directory, not a file
0550+  6E7D             
0551+  6E7D             DSK_MOUNT:
